 heaptop:       , name,
C heaptop() - return the top of the Pascal heap.
C Out: ACC := ~[M1+30B], the complement of the runtime HEAPLIM cell, i.e.
C      the address just above the last word C/NW is allowed to hand out.
                , ntr , 7
             1  , xta , 30b
             1  , aex , 24b
            13  , uj  ,
                , end ,
